SOAPBOX: Boris is remembered as an outstanding contester, innovative developer, and one of the driving forces behind many technical and contesting activities in our region.
SOAPBOX: Bringing S58A back on the air was our way of honoring his legacy and keeping his passion for radio sport alive.
